findings.after:
macontrol keeps two numbers per node and never mixes them:

- "On disk" (map area, sorting): allocated size (`ATTR_FILE_ALLOCSIZE`), hard links once by (dev, fileid). Matches du/Finder "on disk" and keeps parent = sum of children.
- "Frees now" (cleanup button, confirmation sheet): per selection,
  - sum `ATTR_CMNEXT_PRIVATESIZE` of regular files;
  - `UF_COMPRESSED` files: use ALLOCSIZE (PRIVATESIZE reads 0 for decmpfs files, verified-locally);
  - hard-linked inode: counts only if all `nlink` links are in the selection, else 0 (PRIVATESIZE reports full size on every link, verified-locally);
  - full-clone groups (same `ATTR_CMNEXT_CLONEID`, `CLONE_REFCNT` members) wholly inside the selection: add ALLOCSIZE once per group;
  - UI copy: "Frees 1.2 GB now, 6.8 GB is shared with clones or snapshots".

